      "statusChangeID": "5fa876a1c958be7d7ccc9ddc",
      "statusChangeNewStatus": "in progress",
      "value": "So, due to the way Discord Rich Presence works, you must provide a current user count and a maximum user count for any invite link or rich presence update if we want to retain the capability of using the \"Join Game\" link generation feature of Discord for that instance. \nAs such, Invite and Invite+ instances will always show 1 user present in a 2 user capacity room for these types of instances, no matter the current user count. This behavior will be implemented in an upcoming new build.\nWe may change the way this works in the future!",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
