  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "If you're in a invite or invite+ instance and have green status, it will show the current player count in there.\nI feel this is a major concern on the privacy part. No one should know how many I'm with in a invite or invite+ world while on green.\nBlue status I feel this is ok.\nOrange and Red does not show player count.",
